  "correct_answer": [
    "D"
  ],
  "solution": {
    "text": "According to NCERT only <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>NO</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></math> from the given options can retard the photosynthesis process in plants."
